Package: coldstart
Title: Calibrating Generated Items Before Pretesting with Predicted Priors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Edi", email = "danieledi2026@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts Rasch item difficulty from item features (text
    embeddings from any model, template family, content metadata) with honest
    uncertainty, uses the predictions as robust informative priors to
    calibrate new items from small pretest samples, plans the pretest sample
    size needed for a target precision, and diagnoses item families whose
    predictions cannot be trusted.
